      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{5a02271e4397066c68aa3223|full_name}: Oh, I forgot It. At first we may want messaging system to friends... like SMS, or Voice Mail :D\nRealtime talking over the world needs new Player-to-Player session. Probably it is difficult. On the other hand above static messaging system seems more simple to implementation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a0544ebdd98526dee9585f7",
