      "postID": "59f96f55ae96951d913b5862",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "If my memory serves me well a few month ago the request has been totally shredded by Ron in the slack. He was like there's more important stuff to do and we should rely on 3rd party solutions for now. \nThat does not change the facts that: \nA)not every user wants Discord or a similar solution all the time in the background for various reasons.\nB) it destroys our immersion!\nC) AltSpaceVR and maybe others have in- and inter-world text chat since at least one year now.\nD)5.6 is out now so at least one of the more important things is of the list.\nE) We even have full body tracking before we eventually get a simple chat tool? WTF? Compare the number of users with the equipment for FBT and guess how many would use a chat tool....\n\n\nEOF",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
